---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  title: "The Descent | woflo",
  description:
    "an immersive journey through the dimensional tower of codecs. compression, encryption, and communication as one operation.",
  image: "/images/social-card.png",
};
---

<Layout seo={seo}>
  <main class="descent" id="descent">
    <div class="descent__bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- ═══ Act 0 — The Surface ═══ -->
    <section class="act act--surface" id="act-0" aria-label="The surface">
      <div class="pin">
        <div class="scene">
          <div class="pulse-dot"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="copy copy--bottom">
          <p class="quote fade-in">
            what if compression, encryption,<br />and communication were the
            same thing?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="chevron" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg
            width="20"
            height="20"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only"
        >A single pulse of light in darkness. Scroll to descend through the
        dimensional tower of codecs.</span
      >
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Act 1 — Logos (0D) ═══ -->
    <section class="act act--logos" id="act-1" aria-label="Logos: the entropy floor">
      <div class="pin">
        <div class="scene">
          <canvas class="tree-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        </div>
        <div class="copy copy--lower">
          <span class="act-dim">0D</span>
          <h2 class="act-name">Logos</h2>
          <p class="quote">
            before there are dimensions,<br />there is counting.
          </p>
          <div class="counter" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="counter-value">8.00</span>
            <span class="counter-unit">bits / byte</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only"
        >A binary tree of 255 nodes grows from a single point, representing the
        Logos entropy coder learning patterns in data. An entropy counter
        decreases as the tree learns.</span
      >
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Act 2 — The Orthogonal Step (1D→2D) ═══ -->
    <section class="act act--step" id="act-2" aria-label="The orthogonal step">
      <div class="pin">
        <div class="scene">
          <div class="wave-wrap">
            <canvas class="wave-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
          </div>
          <div class="lumen-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="copy copy--lower">
          <span class="act-dim">1D → 2D</span>
          <p class="quote">
            you cannot measure a dimension<br />from inside it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only"
        >A waveform stretches across the screen, then the plane tilts into
        perspective, revealing a second dimension. The orthogonal step: to
        observe structure, stand in a higher dimension.</span
      >
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Act 3 — Loup (8D) ═══ -->
    <section class="act act--loup" id="act-3" aria-label="Loup: the 8D predictor">
      <div class="pin">
        <div class="scene">
          <canvas class="lattice-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        </div>
        <div class="copy copy--lower">
          <span class="act-dim">8D</span>
          <h2 class="act-name">Loup</h2>
          <p class="quote">
            255 neighbors, one for every subset.<br />most of the answer was already on the boundary.
          </p>
          <div class="counter" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="counter-value"></span>
            <span class="counter-unit">subsets</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only"
        >A lattice of 255 nodes blooms outward in concentric rings, each ring
        representing subsets of increasing size. Alternating colors show the
        inclusion-exclusion formula. Most nodes fade as boundary predictions
        prove free — 90% of the structure was already determined.</span
      >
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Act 4 — Kizuna (16D) ═══ -->
    <section class="act act--kizuna" id="act-4" aria-label="Kizuna: the bond">
      <div class="pin">
        <div class="scene">
          <canvas class="kizuna-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        </div>
        <div class="copy copy--lower">
          <span class="act-dim">16D</span>
          <h2 class="act-name">Kizuna</h2>
          <p class="quote">
            the secrets become geometry.<br />the geometry becomes the cipher.
          </p>
          <div class="counter" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="counter-value">0</span>
            <span class="counter-unit">neighbors</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only"
        >Two 8-dimensional lattice blooms approach and collide, merging into
        a single 16-dimensional structure. A shockwave radiates outward. A
        Möbius ring of witnesses orbits the merged lattice. 65,535 neighbors,
        one seal.</span
      >
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Act 5 — Crystallization ═══ -->
    <section class="act act--crystal" id="act-5" aria-label="Crystallization">
      <div class="pin">
        <div class="scene">
          <canvas class="particle-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        </div>
        <div class="copy copy--lower">
          <span class="act-dim">engram</span>
          <p class="quote">
            memory isn't stored.<br />it crystallizes.
          </p>
          <div class="temp-gauge" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="temp-fill"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only"
        >Particles representing engram memory packets move chaotically when hot,
        then cluster into gravity wells and crystallize as scrolling cools the
        system. a phase transition occurs at the percolation threshold.</span
      >
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Act 6 — The Loop ═══ -->
    <section class="act act--loop" id="act-6" aria-label="The loop">
      <div class="pin">
        <div class="scene">
          <canvas class="ratchet-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        </div>
        <div class="copy copy--lower">
          <p class="loop-final">
            compression. encryption. forward secrecy.<br />one operation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only"
        >Messages fall through a vertical tower of codec layers — Logos
        compresses, Loup predicts, Kizuna seals. Each completed message
        advances the ratchet. The key changes. The loop resets.</span
      >
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Coda — The Apple ═══ -->
    <section class="act act--coda" id="act-coda" aria-label="The apple">
      <div class="pin">
        <p class="coda-hint">the only attack surface is the handshake.</p>
        <button class="apple" aria-label="reveal the handshake">
          <div class="apple-dot"></div>
          <div class="apple-interior">
            <svg
              class="ecdh"
              viewBox="0 0 280 100"
              fill="none"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            >
              <!-- exchange lines — alice→center, center→bob -->
              <line x1="50" y1="38" x2="126" y2="38" stroke="rgb(0,255,255)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="3 4" opacity="0.2"></line>
              <line x1="154" y1="38" x2="230" y2="38" stroke="rgb(0,255,255)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="3 4" opacity="0.2"></line>

              <!-- alice -->
              <circle cx="40" cy="38" r="5" fill="rgb(0,255,255)" opacity="0.55"></circle>
              <text x="40" y="60" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="8.5" fill="rgb(245,245,245)" opacity="0.4">alice</text>
              <text x="40" y="71" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Cascadia Code','Fira Code',monospace" font-size="7" fill="rgb(0,255,255)" opacity="0.3">a · G</text>

              <!-- bob -->
              <circle cx="240" cy="38" r="5" fill="rgb(0,255,255)" opacity="0.55"></circle>
              <text x="240" y="60" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="8.5" fill="rgb(245,245,245)" opacity="0.4">bob</text>
              <text x="240" y="71" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Cascadia Code','Fira Code',monospace" font-size="7" fill="rgb(0,255,255)" opacity="0.3">b · G</text>

              <!-- shared secret — the red dot IS the apple -->
              <circle cx="140" cy="38" r="6" fill="rgb(255,0,0)" opacity="0.7"></circle>
              <circle cx="140" cy="38" r="13" fill="none" stroke="rgb(255,0,0)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity="0.25"></circle>
              <text x="140" y="23" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Cascadia Code','Fira Code',monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="rgb(255,0,0)" opacity="0.55">a · b · G</text>

              <!-- protocol -->
              <text x="140" y="90" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Cascadia Code','Fira Code',monospace" font-size="6" fill="rgb(245,245,245)" opacity="0.18">X25519 + Double Ratchet</text>
            </svg>
            <p class="coda-quote">everything else is geometry.</p>
          </div>
        </button>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only"
        >A single red dot represents the only vulnerability: the handshake.
        Clicking reveals the ECDH key exchange. Everything else is protected
        by geometry.</span
      >
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  /* ============================================================
     THE DESCENT — /whisper/codecs
     immersive scroll experience through the codec tower
     ============================================================ */

  /* --- reset for immersion --- */

  .descent {
    background: #0a0a0a;
    color: #f5f5f5;
    position: relative;
    /* kill all text selection — this is an experience, not a document */
    -webkit-user-select: none;
    user-select: none;
    /* prevent overscroll bounce on ios/chrome revealing the page behind */
    overscroll-behavior: none;
    /* hide the text cursor everywhere */
    cursor: default;
  }

  /* allow selection only on the actual quotes (someone might want to copy them) */
  .descent .quote,
  .descent .coda-quote,
  .descent .coda-hint,
  .descent .loop-final {
    -webkit-user-select: text;
    user-select: text;
    cursor: text;
  }

  /* suppress right-click context menu on canvases and visuals */
  .descent canvas,
  .descent .scene,
  .descent .apple-dot {
    -webkit-touch-callout: none;
  }

  /* full immersion — suppress site chrome */
  body:has(.descent) .site-header {
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    position: fixed;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease-out;
  }

  body:has(.descent) #main {
    padding-bottom: 0;
    /* no overscroll glow/bounce */
    overscroll-behavior: none;
  }

  body:has(.descent) #site-footer {
    display: none !important;
  }

  /* kill scrollbar — the progress bar replaces it */
  body:has(.descent) {
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  body:has(.descent)::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  /* progress bar */
  .descent__bar {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgb(0 255 255 / 0.2);
    width: calc(var(--scroll-progress, 0) * 100%);
    z-index: 200;
    pointer-events: none;
    will-change: width;
  }

  /* ── shared act layout ────────────────────────────────── */

  .act {
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  .pin {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    height: 100dvh;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .scene {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .copy--bottom {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 18vh;
    left: 50%;
    --reveal: 0;
    opacity: var(--reveal);
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(calc((1 - var(--reveal)) * 10px));
  }

  .copy--lower {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 10vh;
    left: 50%;
    --reveal: 0;
    opacity: var(--reveal);
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(calc((1 - var(--reveal)) * 10px));
  }

  /* --- typography --- */

  .quote {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 200;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1rem + 1vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    color: rgb(245 245 245 / 0.75);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .act-dim {
    font-family: "Cascadia Code", "Fira Code", monospace;
    font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 0.65rem + 0.3vw, 0.85rem);
    color: rgb(0 255 255 / 0.45);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .act-name {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.2rem + 1.5vw, 2.4rem);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-shadow:
      -1px 0 0 rgb(0 255 255 / 0.35),
      1px 0 0 rgb(255 0 0 / 0.35);
  }

  .counter {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5em;
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  .counter-value {
    font-family: "Cascadia Code", "Fira Code", monospace;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.9rem + 0.5vw, 1.3rem);
    color: rgb(0 255 255);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .counter-unit {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(0.65rem, 0.6rem + 0.25vw, 0.8rem);
    color: rgb(245 245 245 / 0.4);
  }

  /* ── act 0 — the surface ────────────────────────────── */

  .act--surface {
    height: 160vh;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgb(0 255 255);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 20px rgb(0 255 255 / 0.4),
      0 0 60px rgb(0 255 255 / 0.15),
      0 0 120px rgb(0 255 255 / 0.06);
    animation: pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: scale(1);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    50% {
      transform: scale(1.4);
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .act--surface .copy {
    --reveal: clamp(0, var(--p) * 3, 1);
  }

  .chevron {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 6vh;
    left: 50%;
    color: rgb(0 255 255 / 0.25);
    animation: drift 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes drift {
    0%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0.25;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
    }
    50% {
      opacity: 0.5;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(6px);
    }
  }

  /* fade chevron as user scrolls */
  .act--surface .chevron {
    opacity: calc(1 - var(--p) * 4);
  }

  /* ── act 1 — logos ────────────────────────────────────── */

  .act--logos {
    height: 220vh;
  }

  .tree-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .act--logos .copy {
    --reveal: clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.08) * 6, 1);
  }

  /* ── act 2 — the step ─────────────────────────────────── */

  .act--step {
    height: 220vh;
  }

  .wave-wrap {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* tilt into 3D in second half — no transition, rAF drives --p at 60fps */
    transform:
      perspective(800px)
      rotateX(calc(clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.45) * 3.6, 1) * 55deg));
    transform-origin: center 60%;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .wave-canvas {
    width: min(90vw, 700px);
    height: min(35vw, 280px);
  }

  .lumen-grid {
    position: absolute;
    width: min(90vw, 700px);
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    background-image:
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        rgb(0 255 255 / 0.06) 0 1px,
        transparent 1px 12.5%
      ),
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        rgb(0 255 255 / 0.06) 0 1px,
        transparent 1px 12.5%
      );
    transform:
      perspective(800px)
      rotateX(calc(clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.45) * 3.6, 1) * 55deg));
    transform-origin: center 60%;
    opacity: calc(clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.5) * 4, 1));
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .act--step .copy {
    --reveal: clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.04) * 5, 1);
  }

  /* ── act 3 — loup (8D) ───────────────────────────────── */

  .act--loup {
    height: 320vh;
  }

  .lattice-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .act--loup .copy {
    --reveal: clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.6) * 4, 1);
  }


  /* ── act 4 — kizuna (16D) ─────────────────────────────── */

  .act--kizuna {
    height: 280vh;
  }

  .kizuna-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .act--kizuna .copy {
    --reveal: clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.06) * 4, 1);
  }

  /* ── act 5 — crystallization ──────────────────────────── */

  .act--crystal {
    height: 280vh;
  }

  .particle-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .temp-gauge {
    width: 3px;
    height: 60px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.06);
    border-radius: 2px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .temp-fill {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgb(0 255 255 / 0.5), rgb(255 80 40 / 0.6));
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: height 0.15s ease-out;
  }

  .act--crystal .copy {
    --reveal: clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.04) * 4, 1);
  }

  /* ── act 6 — the loop ─────────────────────────────────── */

  .act--loop {
    height: 300vh;
  }

  .ratchet-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .act--loop .copy {
    --reveal: clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.75) * 4, 1);
  }

  .loop-final {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 200;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1rem + 0.8vw, 1.6rem);
    color: rgb(245 245 245 / 0.8);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── coda — the apple ─────────────────────────────────── */

  .act--coda {
    height: 100vh;
  }

  .act--coda .pin {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .coda-hint {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 200;
    font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 0.8rem + 0.3vw, 1rem);
    color: rgb(245 245 245 / 0.3);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .apple {
    position: relative;
    width: min(300px, 70vw);
    height: min(220px, 50vw);
    border: none;
    background: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  }

  .apple:focus-visible {
    outline: 1px solid rgb(255 0 0 / 0.4);
    outline-offset: 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .apple-dot {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgb(255 0 0);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 20px rgb(255 0 0 / 0.3),
      0 0 50px rgb(255 0 0 / 0.1);
    transition:
      transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1),
      opacity 0.4s ease-out;
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .apple:hover .apple-dot {
    box-shadow:
      0 0 25px rgb(255 0 0 / 0.45),
      0 0 60px rgb(255 0 0 / 0.15);
  }

  .apple.cracked .apple-dot {
    transform: scale(30);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .apple-interior {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.92);
    transition:
      opacity 0.6s ease-out 0.25s,
      transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1) 0.25s;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .apple.cracked .apple-interior {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }


  .ecdh {
    width: min(340px, 72vw);
    height: auto;
  }

  .coda-quote {
    font-family: "Comic Neue", cursive;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 0.8rem + 0.5vw, 1.15rem);
    color: rgb(245 245 245 / 0.65);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  /* ── transitions between acts (glitch dividers) ───────── */

  .act + .act::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 10%;
    right: 10%;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent,
      rgb(0 255 255 / 0.15) 30%,
      rgb(0 255 255 / 0.15) 70%,
      transparent
    );
    z-index: 10;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ── responsive ────────────────────────────────────────── */

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .quote {
      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 0.85rem + 0.8vw, 1.3rem);
    }

    .act-name {
      font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 1.1rem + 1vw, 1.8rem);
    }

    .copy--bottom {
      bottom: 14vh;
    }

    .copy--lower {
      bottom: 7vh;
    }

  }

  /* pen/stylus hover states */
  @media (pointer: fine) and (hover: hover) {
    .apple-dot {
      transition:
        transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1),
        opacity 0.4s ease-out,
        box-shadow 0.3s ease-out;
    }
  }

  /* ── reduced motion ───────────────────────────────────── */

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pulse-dot {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .chevron {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 0.35;
    }

    .apple-dot {
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }

    .apple.cracked .apple-dot {
      transform: none;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .apple-interior {
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
